{{head|zh|hanzi}}

# to [[dispute]]; to [[fight]]
#: {{zh-x|冇 咩 好 爭{zaang1}。|It is nothing to '''fight''' over.|C}}
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|兩 個 人 爭 了 半天，其實 說 的 是 一 回 事。|Those two have been '''arguing''' for all day, but actually they're the same point.|M-YZ}}
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|都 講 得 冒得 鬧，不 要 爭 唎！|He's not wrong in the first place, stop '''disputing'''!|G}}
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|伊 兩 隻 大 爭。|Those two had a big fight.|MD}}
#: {{zh-x|開 開玩笑，兩家頭 就 爭 起來 了。|tr=sh:1khe khe+6woe shiau&6lian ka deu&6zhieu&1tsan+5chi le&8leq|After some bantering, those two started '''fighting'''.|SH}}
# to [[contend]]
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|明個 飯後 我們 跟 他們 爭 冠軍。|Tomorrow, after lunch, we'll be '''contending''' for the first place against them.|M-YZ}}
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|大家 爭 倒 發言。|tr=da4 jia1 zen1 dao fa2 yan2|Everyone is '''fighting''' for a chance to speak.|M-S}}
# to [[strive]]
#: {{zh-x|爭氣|to '''strive''' to excel}}
# {{lb|zh|dialectal Mandarin|Cantonese|dialectal Hakka|Jin|dialectal Min|Southern Wu}} to [[lack]]; to be [[missing]]; [[still]] [[have]]; [[remaining]]
#: {{zh-x|佢哋 間 屋 仲 爭{zaang1} 個 廁{ci3}所 未 裝。|Their house still hasn't had the bathroom installed yet.|C}}
#: {{zh-x|到 機場 仲 爭{zaang1} 幾 分鐘。|There are still a couple minutes until we reach the airport.|C}}
#: {{zh-co|好似 爭{zaang1} 減{gam2} 啲 嘢|seems to be missing something|C}}
# {{lb|zh|Cantonese}} to have a [[difference]] {{q|expressed in conjunction with terms of physical distance}}
#: {{zh-x|同 X 爭{zaang1} 好 遠|to be greatly different from X|C}}
#: {{zh-x|同 X 爭{zaang1} 十萬八千里|to be radically different from X ("be different by 108,000 ''li''")|C}}
# {{lb|zh|Ürümqi Mandarin}} [[argumentative]]
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|他 那個 人 太 爭 咧，和 誰 都 處 不好。|He's way too '''argumentative''', he can't hang out with anyone.|M-LY}}
# {{lb|zh|Ürümqi Mandarin}} to [[open up]]
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|把 口袋 爭 開，好 往 裡 裝。|'''Open up''' your pocket, let's put it in there.|M-LY}}
# {{lb|zh|dialectal}} to [[owe]]
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|我 還 爭 你 三 角 錢，明天 給 你。|tr=ngo3 huan2 zen1 nyi3 san1 go2 qian2 min2 tian1 ge1 nyi3|I still owe you thirty cents, I'll give it to you tomorrow.|M-S}}
# {{lb|zh|Wanrong Mandarin}} [[because]]; [[due to]]; [[so that]]
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|他 倆 爭 一 句 話 吵 起 啦。|They started fighting '''because of''' a small line.|M-CP}}
# {{lb|zh|Wanrong Mandarin}} [[capable]]
#: {{syn|zh|能幹}} {{q|Standard}}
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|你 可 爭 哩，做 活 能 頂 幾 外 人。|You're rather '''capable''' aren't you, what you do is comparable to multiple others.|M-CP}}
# {{lb|zh|Suzhounese Wu|Dongguan Yue}} to [[argue]] [[for the sake of]] arguing
#: {{syn|zh|抬槓}} {{q|Standard}}
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|吾 勿 搭 倷 爭，到 辰光 看 到 底 啥人 對。|I can't be bothered to '''bicker''' with you, we'll see who's right eventually.|W-SZ}}
# {{lb|zh|Wenzhounese Wu}} [[different]]
#* {{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects}}
#*: {{zh-q|讀 大專 伉 讀 本科 是 有 爭 個。|Going to community college and going to university for an undergrad are '''different''' though.|W-WZ}}
# {{lb|zh|Jinhua Wu}} to have [[reservation]]s
