Glossed as “{{l|pt|igualmente|I[gualmente]}}, ''chichi''. {{m|pt|pai|Pay}}” (“same as ''chichi''. ''Father''”) in ''{{w|Nippo Jisho}}''.<ref>{{cite book|year=1604|title=Nippo Jisho|chapter=Tete|page=256|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=TFJAAQAAMAAJ&pg=PP513&q=Tete}}</ref>

Shift from ''chichi''.<ref name="KDJ"/><ref name="DJS">{{R:Daijisen}}</ref>

Usage continued until at least the early 1700s.<ref name="KDJ"/>

