===Etymology===
From some language ancestral to modern {{cog|hmx}} languages, from {{der|zh|hmx-pro|*qluwˣ||dog}}, perhaps from {{der|zh|map-pro|*(u-)(ŋ)kuɣkuɣ||dog}} ({{zh-ref|Norman, 1988}}; {{zh-ref|Benedict, 1996}}).

Alternatively, STEDT derives this from {{inh|zh|sit-pro|*d-kʷəj-n||dog}}, whence also {{och-l|犬}}.

Less likely, it may be related to {{och-l|駒|foal}}, {{och-l|羔|lamb}}, {{och-l|𤘽|calf}} ({{zh-ref|Wang, 1982}}).

